{'translated_term': 'Volumatik Sosiala Matematik', 'translation_rationale': 'I used the prefix "Volumatik" which is derived from "Volume", to convey the computational aspect of data processing and analysis in social science. The suffix "-tik" is commonly used in Volapük to denote a process or technique, and the word "Sosiala" means social or relations-based, while "Matematik" refers to mathematics, hence encompassing the computational element.', 'alternative_terms': ['Volumatik Sosiolijik Matematik', 'Matematik Volumatik Sosiala']}

